Revenue Model

Protocol Lending Fees: Spread between what borrowers pay and what suppliers earn, plus fees from features. Revenue streams include borrow interest and liquidation fees.

Status: Live

Swap Fees: Fees from the aave.com interface.

Status: Live

App Fees: Product fees from Aave applications.

Status: Live

GHO Stablecoin Revenue: Aave's native stablecoin GHO generates annualized revenue, projecting more than $14 million by end of 2025.

Status: Live

Chainlink SVR: Smart Value Recapture from Chainlink oracles.

Status: Live

