Financial Dependencies

Aave DAO: Governs the core lending smart contracts, sets risk parameters, and accumulates protocol-level revenue into the treasury.

Aave Labs: For-profit development company behind the Aave protocol; receives funding from DAO for development.

VC Investors: Multiple venture capital firms have provided funding across various rounds.

